icken in the oven and bake while you prepare the romaine, about 5 minutes.","secondary_message":""},{"id":63214,"primary_message":"Wash and dry lettuce. Quarter lengthwise. Place on sheet with chicken and season with salt and pepper.","secondary_message":"3 heads romaine lettuce\n⅜ tsp salt\n⅜ tsp black pepper"},{"id":63213,"primary_message":"Return sheet to the oven and roast until chicken is cooked through and romaine is browned at the edges, another 5-10 minutes.","secondary_message":""},{"id":63212,"primary_message":"Cut 1 ½ lemon into wedges.","secondary_message":""},{"id":63211,"primary_message":"To serve, place chicken and romaine hearts on a plate. Garnish with lemon wedges and sprinkle romaine hearts with pine nuts. Enjoy!","secondary_message":"⅜ cup pine nuts"}],"line_items":[{"id":67607,"quantity":"0.681 kg","ingredient_name":"chicken breasts, boneless skinless"},{"id":67605,"quantity":"3 cloves","ingredient_name":"garlic"},{"id":67606,"quantity":"1 ½ small bunches","ingredient_name":"Italian (flat-leaf) parsley"},{"id":67604,"quantity":"1 ½","ingredient_name":"lemons"},{"id":67601,"quantity":"84 g","ingredient_name":"Parmesan cheese"},{"id":67600,"quantity":"0.375 cup","ingredient_name":"pine nuts"},{"id":67597,"quantity":"3 heads","ingredient_name":"romaine lettuce"},{"id":67603,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"black pepper"},{"id":67598,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"extra virgin olive oil"},{"id":67602,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"panko bread crumbs"},{"id":67599,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"salt"}],"nutrition":{"energy":462.58,"alcohol":0.0,"ash":5.34,"caffeine":0.0,"water":409.91,"carbs":19.66,"fiber":7.84,"starch":5.12,"sugars":5.05,"fructose":2.88,"galactose":0.0,"glucose":1.5,"lactose":0.11,"maltose":0.14,"sucrose":0.38,"sugar_alcohol":0.0,"fat":27.55,"monounsaturated":13.57,"polyunsaturated":5.56,"omega_3":0.59,"omega_6":4.97,"saturated":5.48,"transfats":0.12,"cholesterol":92.38,"protein":37.15,"alanine":1.94,"arginine":2.35,"aspartic_